  "interpretation": "Bounded reading of the complete materialized Greek chapter, retaining Aristotle’s contrast between causes of being and generation. His criticism requires an initiating mover for coming-to-be even if Forms exist; this is not a denial of every constitutive explanation by Forms. Kept as prose because the finite Produces relation does not encode a full theory of natural generation.",
